# Generated AIDL bindings for current/ (#566) — regenerated by the
# toolchain on every build. Never committed for current/; only committed
# under <module>/<version>/ when ./release.sh freezes a cohort.
#
# A leading-* pattern matches a single path segment, so */current/include/
# reaches <module>/current/include/ but not <module>/kvc/current/include/.
# The ** form covers a vocabulary's current/ as well, which follows the same
# rule: a frozen revision commits its generated output, current/ does not.
**/current/include/
**/current/src/

# Generated presentations
*.pdf
!docs/presentations/**/*.pdf

